{"ID":"20240718160632-j9n6kdo","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240718160632-j9n6kdo","title":"艳山姜","type":"doc","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240718160643-s7fs7l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718160643-s7fs7l9","updated":"20240718160643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 374px;","style":"width: 364px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁 6-20240718153350-tg28v4i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 364px;\" parent-style=\"width: 374px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 810px;","style":"width: 800px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁-20240718152805-cb1y9rt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 800px;\" parent-style=\"width: 810px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718160643-sd4i36d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718160643-sd4i36d","updated":"20240718160643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 672px;","style":"width: 662px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁 5-20240718153244-pc1ach7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 662px;\" parent-style=\"width: 672px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁 10-20240718153802-mslxqfh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718160643-to7gd6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718160643-to7gd6f","updated":"20240718160643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 511px;","style":"width: 501px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁 14-20240718154020-3jcslkm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 501px;\" parent-style=\"width: 511px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 679px;","style":"width: 669px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁 15-20240718154224-r52xaih.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 669px;\" parent-style=\"width: 679px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718160643-c4mvzd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718160643-c4mvzd4","updated":"20240718160643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 421px;","style":"width: 411px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁 13-20240718153953-bxnvvfx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 411px;\" parent-style=\"width: 421px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 356px;","style":"width: 346px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁 12-20240718153920-epu74ao.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 346px;\" parent-style=\"width: 356px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 488px;","style":"width: 478px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砂仁 (16)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砂仁 16-20240718154304-peh88uk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 478px;\" parent-style=\"width: 488px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718162029-ymq8z87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718162029-ymq8z87","updated":"20240726170221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 416px;","style":"width: 406px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"艳山姜 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/艳山姜 1-20240718162112-znnge78.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 406px;\" parent-style=\"width: 416px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 417px;","style":"width: 407px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"艳山姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/艳山姜-20240718162029-70dlupx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 407px;\" parent-style=\"width: 417px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 418px;","style":"width: 408px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"艳山姜 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/艳山姜 2-20240718162213-yz86l9u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 408px;\" parent-style=\"width: 418px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718162317-2jybcdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718162317-2jybcdh","updated":"20240726171138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 514px;","style":"width: 504px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"艳山姜 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/艳山姜 3-20240718162317-0oufxmf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 504px;\" parent-style=\"width: 514px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726172047-d9vawjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726172047-d9vawjb","updated":"20240727120933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：关于姜科植物艳山姜众说纷纭，有称豆蔻、草豆蔻、红豆蔻都有、个人难以查证，故区分开，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如错误烦请指正"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"只知道都能作香料使用；点我跳转豆蔻→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240205153758-tynlpdj","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"豆蔻（草豆蔻、白豆蔻、红豆蔻、肉豆蔻）"}]},{"ID":"20240727114136-4wnce3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727114136-4wnce3j","updated":"20240808163231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：据说豆蔻年华的豆蔻指的是艳山姜；"}]},{"ID":"20240718160632-mnbdnfl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240718160632-mnbdnfl"}},{"ID":"20240902155950-sijbw6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-sijbw6m","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：艳山姜"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-jrc1p42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-jrc1p42","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"艳山姜"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-0rbn83o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-0rbn83o","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】本品以玉桃之名始见于《植物名实图考》，谓：“玉桃，叶如芭蕉，抽长茎，开花成串，花苞如小绿桃。花开露瓣，如黄蝴蝶花稍大。”根据上述及其附图，应为现姜科植物艳山姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-7ijhdsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-7ijhdsj","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】YànShānJiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-uvrj7yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-uvrj7yw","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】玉桃、草扣、大良姜、大草蔻、假砂仁、土砂仁、草豆蔻"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-g4n2z6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-g4n2z6x","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-hl6ayxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-hl6ayxx","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为姜科植物艳山姜的根茎和果实。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-7f3tyvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-7f3tyvu","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Alpiniazerumbet（Pers.）Burtt.etSmith[CostuszerumbetPers.；Alpiniaspeciosa（Wendl.）K.Schurn.]"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-qjx4wv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-qjx4wv2","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：根茎全年均可采，鲜用或切片晒干。果实将熟时采收，烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-x5itczy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-x5itczy","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】艳山姜，多年生常绿草本，高1.5-3m。叶大，互生；叶柄长1-1.5cm；叶舌长5-10mm，外被毛；叶片披针形，长30-60cm，宽5-15cm，先端渐尖而有一旋卷的小尖头，基部渐狭，边缘具短柔毛，两面均无毛。圆锥花序呈总状花序式，下垂，长达30cm，花序轴紫红色，被绒毛，分枝极短，每一分枝上有花l-2朵；小苞片椭圆形，长3-3.5cm，白色，先端粉红色，蕾时包裹住花，无毛；小花梗极短；花萼近钟形，长约2cm，白色，光瑞粉红色，一侧开裂，先端2齿裂；花冠管较花萼为短，裂片长圆形，长约3cm，后方的1枚较大，乳白色，先端粉红色；侧生退化雄蕊钻状，长约2mm；唇瓣匙状宽卵形，长4-6cm，先端皱波状，黄色而有紫红色纹彩；雄蕊长约2.5cm；子房被金黄色粗毛；腺体长约2.5mm。蒴果卵圆形，直径约2cm，被稀疏的粗毛，具显露的纵向条纹，先端常冠以宿萼，熟时朱红色；种子有棱角。花期4-6月，果期7-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-y63cvlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-y63cvlm","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-g34pxvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-g34pxvf","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于田头、地边、路旁及沟边草丛中，常栽培于房前屋后及庭园供观赏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-0yt2znq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-0yt2znq","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于我国东南部至西南部各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-yj0uwz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-yj0uwz4","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-ftada0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-ftada0t","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别：果实呈球形，两端略尖，长约2cm，直径1.5cm，黄棕色，略有光泽，有10数条隆起的纵棱，顶端具一突起，为花被残基，基部有的具果柄断痕。种子团瓣排列疏松，易散落，假种皮膜质，白色。种子为多面体，长4-5mm，直径3-4mm。味淡，略辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-r64rrfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-r64rrfw","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别：2.1.种子横切面：种皮表皮细胞类方形。下皮为2-3列细胞，长方形或类方形，切向排列，内含黄褐色物，色素层为数列棕色细胞，其中散有类圆形油滴；内种皮为1列栅状石细胞，棕黄色，内壁及侧壁极厚，胞腔小，内含硅质块。外胚乳细胞含草酸钙方晶。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-2i29n4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-2i29n4t","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：灰棕色。①假种皮细胞较大，常成团；单个细胞呈纺锤形，有的呈椭圆形，末端多修大，腔胞中含颗粒状物。②皮表皮细胞呈多角形，常见下皮细胞与之重叠。③下皮细胞壁薄。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-or8t12t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-or8t12t","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④.石细胞多用状或类圆形。⑤油细胞较大，卵圆形，含棕色物。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-bi90by3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-bi90by3","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】种子含小豆蔻查耳酮(cardamonin)，即2′，4′-二羟基-6′-甲氧基查耳酮(2′，4′-dihydroxy-6′-methoxychalcone)，山姜素(alpinetin)即7-羟基-5-甲氧基黄烷酮(7-hydroxy-5-methoxyflavanone。根茎含龙脑(borneo1)，肉桂酸甲酯(methylcinnamate)，樟脑(camphor)，α-蒎烯(α-pinene),β-蒎烯(β-pinene)，桉叶素(l，8-cineole)，对-聚伞花素(p-cymene)，α-侧柏烯(α-thujene)，香桧烯(sabinene)，柠檬烯(limonene)，γ-松油烯(γ-terpinene)，4-松油醇(4-terpineol)，二氢-5，6-去氢卡瓦胡椒素(dihydro-5，6-dehydrokawain)，5，6-去氢卡瓦胡椒素(5，6-dehydrokawain)，β-谷甾醇(β-sitostosterol)，小豆蔻查耳酮，山姜黄，对香豆酸(p-coumaricacid)，2′羟基-4′，6′二甲氧基二氢查耳酮(2′-hydroxy-4′，6′-dimethoxydihydrochalcone)，2′-羟基-4′，6′-二甲氧基查耳酮(2′-hydroxy-4′，6′-dimethoxychal-cone)，8(17)，12-半日花二烯-15，16-二醛[labda-8(7l)，12-diene-15，16-dial]，棕榈酸-β-谷甾醇酯(β-sitoterylpalmitate)，菜油甾醇(campesterol)，豆甾醇(stigmasterol)，由棕榈酸(palmiticacid)、硬脂酸(stearicacid)、花生酸(arachidicacid)、山萮酸(behenicacid)、二十四烷酸(lignocericacid)和二十烷醇(l-eicosanol)、二十二烷醇(1-docosanol)、二十四烷醇(1-tetracosanol)、二十六烷醇(1-hexacosanol)组成的混合酯，氯化钾(KCI)，二氢黄卡瓦胡椒素(dihydrovokawain)B，黄卡瓦胡椒素(flavokawain)B，15，16-双去甲半日花-8(17)，11-二烯-13-酮[15，16-bisnor-labda-8(17)，11-dien-13-one]。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-82sf5z1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-82sf5z1","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】大草蔻叶的水、醇提取物能抑制离体蛙心，收缩离体豚鼠肠管，对蟾蜍腹直肌无作用，对小鼠毒性很小。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-sh58w5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-sh58w5l","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-ymm133i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-ymm133i","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理化鉴别：（1）取本品粗粉1g,加石油醚10ml，浸过夜，滤液为棕黄色。置紫外灯（365nm）观察，显黄白色荧光。滴加5％香草醛-浓硫酸，显紫色至暗紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-ohuibim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-ohuibim","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）薄层色谱：取本品粗粉２g，加乙醚15ml，浸２小时，滤过；滤液挥尽乙醚，残渣加甲醇0.5ml溶解，作供试品溶液。另取飞照品龙脑加无水乙醇制成每lml含20mg的溶液和龙脑酸乙酯加无水乙醇制成10％的溶液作对照品溶液。分别吸取供试品溶液5μl和对照品溶液各3μl，点于同一硅胶G层析板上。用正己烷-乙酸乙酯（85：b5）展开，展距15cm。取出后喷2％香草醛硫酸溶液，105℃烘10分钟。供试品色谱中与对照品色谱的相应位置，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-eqmc4kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-eqmc4kb","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；涩；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-hfmh7c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-hfmh7c7","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】温中燥湿；行气止痛；截疟。主心腹冷痛；胸腹胀满；消化不良；呕吐腹泻；疟疾"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-c5jb44t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-c5jb44t","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，种子或根茎3-9g；种子研末，每次1.5g。外用：适量，鲜根茎捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902155950-nmynmsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155950-nmynmsp","updated":"20240902155955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902155951-9fog4ku","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902155951-9fog4ku","updated":"20240902155955"}},{"ID":"20240902155952-oumhmuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902155952-oumhmuf","updated":"20240902155955"}}]}